  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helmsley Charitable Trust (HCT) - Changa Cooperative Livelihood Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Livestock and Crops).Beneficiaries: 420 farmers.Description: Farmers from Changa Comsip Cooperative Society Limited are seeking for funding to improve their livestock and crop production in order to improve their livelihoods. Specifically, they are looking at digging a borehole, establishing demonstration plots with drip irrigation, organize their cooperative to be sustainable and increase their profit margin for improved livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
